# CR 508.1c: Gust Walker (2/2, "you may exert this as it attacks. When you
# do, it gets +1/+1 and gains flying until end of turn") attacks alone and
# is exerted -- exertDeclaredAttackers (attack.go) offers it right after
# tapping, before target assignment; ExertAttackers's chosen answer sets
# Card.Exerted and pushes the static ability's own Trigger$ payoff
# (resolveOptionalAttackCostPayoff), resolved here through resolvestack.
# GameState's own dump format (dump.go) has no Exerted/granted-keyword/PT
# field to assert against -- Card.Exerted and the Pump/Flying payoff are
# proven at module level instead (attack_test.go,
# TestDeclareCombatAttackersExertsAndRunsPayoff). This fixture's own value
# is compiling and running a real corpus S:Mode$ OptionalAttackCost card
# (Gust Walker) end to end through the whole engine, tap included.
startturn human
advance 5
queue attackers 1
queue exertattackers 1
declareattackers
resolvestack
